---
import '../../styles/global.css';
---
<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>Tickets — MAGColor Experience Lisboa 2026</title></head><body>
<script>document.querySelectorAll('[data-fade]').forEach(el=>{new IntersectionObserver((e,o)=>{e.forEach(x=>{if(x.isIntersecting){x.target.classList.add('is-visible');o.unobserve(x.target)}})},{threshold:0.12}).observe(el)});document.querySelectorAll('[data-lang]').forEach(el=>{el.addEventListener('click',(e)=>{e.preventDefault();const l=el.dataset.lang;const p=window.location.pathname.replace(/^\/(pt|es|en)\//,'/'+l+'/').replace(/^\/(pt|es|en)$/,'/'+l);window.location.href=p})})</script>
<article class="page">
  <div class="pt-flag"></div>
<header class="hdr"><div class="hdr-inner"><a href="/en/"><img src="/logo.png" class="logo" alt="MAGColor"></a><nav class="nav"><a href="/en/" class="nav-item">Home</a><a href="/en/ponentes" class="nav-item">Speakers</a><a href="/en/programa" class="nav-item">Program</a><a href="/en/entradas" class="nav-item active">Tickets</a><a href="/en/faq" class="nav-item">FAQ</a></nav><div class="hdr-right"><div class="lang"><a href="#" data-lang="pt" class="lang-pill">PT</a><a href="#" data-lang="es" class="lang-pill">ES</a><a href="#" data-lang="en" class="lang-pill active">EN</a></div><a href="/en/entradas" class="btn btn-gold btn-sm">Reserve My Spot</a></div></div></header>
<section class="sec" style="padding-top:140px"><div class="wrap" data-fade>
<div class="center-block" style="margin-bottom:48px"><div class="badge">TICKETS</div><h2 class="h2">Choose how you want to experience MAGColor</h2><p class="sub-tert">Three ways to experience according to access level, proximity and exclusivity. All include the full event, training, simultaneous translation and the White Gala Dinner.</p></div>

<div class="tiers" id="tiers"></div>
<div class="extra-grid mt-64"><div class="card extra-card"><span class="extra-icon">🎁</span><h3 class="card-title">First 20 tickets with exclusive benefit</h3><p class="card-desc">The first 20 tickets will have access to an exclusive discount by paying via bank transfer or Bizum. Additional gift sent before the event.</p><p class="fine-print">Available only for the first 20 · Full payment · Transfer or Bizum</p><a href="https://wa.me/34696808098" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-top:auto">Request discount via WhatsApp</a></div><div class="card extra-card"><span class="extra-icon">💎</span><h3 class="card-title">Recover 100% of your ticket in elite training</h3><p class="card-desc">All tickets include an equivalent training voucher, applicable to Instituto Miriam Alcántara programs.</p><a href="https://wa.me/34696808098" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-top:auto">View conditions</a></div></div>
<script is:inline src="/data-en.js"></script>
</body></html>
